  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHv/1182",
  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>수업장학 할 때&nbsp;재과만에서 아이디어를 얻어 \"행성여행상품 광고물만들기\"를 하고&nbsp;광고(발표)하는 시간을 가졌습니다.</p><p>여중이라 학생들이 확실히 미술실력이 있어서 괜찮은 작품들이 나와 혼자 보기 아까워 올려 봅니다.</p><p>홈쇼핑처럼&nbsp;여행상품을 광고하도록 시켰는데 어찌나 발표들을 천연덕스럽고 재미지게 말하던지 요즘 학생들은 못하는 것이 없네요^^</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/274A554D574BC7C40A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"576\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20160530_133832_HDR.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"576\"  id=\"A_274A554D574BC7C40AF036\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2253B64D574BC7C701\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"576\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20160530_133612_HDR.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"576\"  id=\"A_2253B64D574BC7C701D73A\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/21316A4D574BC7CA20\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"576\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20160530_133712_HDR.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"576\"  id=\"A_21316A4D574BC7CA206CC3\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2151A64D574BC7CE03\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"576\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20160530_133530_HDR.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"576\"  id=\"A_2151A64D574BC7CE0338BB\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2629334D574BC7D02A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"699\" height=\"476\" style=\"width: 699px; height: 476px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20160530_133436_HDR.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_2629334D574BC7D02A8D9B\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2734394D574BC7D41D\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"576\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20160530_133454_HDR.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"576\"  id=\"A_2734394D574BC7D41DD78C\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/222AE44D574BC7D727\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"576\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20160530_133703_HDR.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"576\"  id=\"A_222AE44D574BC7D72703C9\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2119974C574BC7DA30\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"702\" height=\"406\" style=\"width: 702px; height: 406px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20160530_133924_HDR.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_2119974C574BC7DA30B31E\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
